{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Pp09k79kCD1792191090.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報飛機製造商波音旗下737 MAX 10飛機，快將獲美國聯邦航空局發出飛行認證。</p><p></p><p>《路透》引述三名知情人士稱，美國聯邦航空局已於周五完成一項關鍵安全審查，最快下星期向737 MAX 10發出飛行認證。</p><p></p><p>MAX 10是波音最暢銷的737 MAX系列中最大型的飛機型號，其獲發飛行認證將是公司一項重要里程碑。此系列飛機在2018及2019年曾先後發生兩次致命空難；至2024年，又發生機艙門塞爆裂事故，令波音的飛機面對更嚴格的認證程序。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T23:39:13.744859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T23:57:34.810335+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:38.347710+00:00","content_hash":"953a9fcd4b33e0f15b2056ab5d0ab9a0a0746432dc2310c03b7c56555485f252","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}